%% Sequence diagram — `sequenceDiagram`. Participants are columns with vertical
%% lifelines; messages are time-ordered arrows flowing top to bottom.
%%   ->>   solid line + arrowhead       -->>  dashed line + arrowhead (return)
%%   ->    solid line                   -->   dashed line
%%   A->>A self-message (loop)          Note right of X / over X,Y
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant W as Web App
    participant DB as Database

    U->>W: submit form
    W->>W: validate
    W->>DB: INSERT row
    DB-->>W: ok (id=42)
    W-->>U: 201 Created
    Note right of DB: row is durable
